# Prometheus, Node Exporter & Grafana Installation

## Monitoring Architecture

Launch **2 Ubuntu/EC2 instances**:

```text
VM1 — Monitoring Server
    ├── Prometheus
    └── Grafana

VM2 — Target Server
    └── Node Exporter
```

### Required Ports

For the demo environment, allow the required ports in the EC2 Security Group:

| Port | Component     | Purpose               |
| ---: | ------------- | --------------------- |
| 9090 | Prometheus    | Prometheus Web UI     |
| 3000 | Grafana       | Grafana Web UI        |
| 9100 | Node Exporter | Node Exporter metrics |

> For production, avoid allowing these ports from `0.0.0.0/0`. Restrict access to trusted IPs or security groups.

