# Complete Monitoring Flow

```text
                  Monitoring Server
             ┌────────────────────────┐
             │                        │
             │      Prometheus        │
             │          │             │
             │          ▼             │
             │       Grafana          │
             │                        │
             └──────────┬─────────────┘
                        │
                 Collect Metrics
                        │
                        ▼
             ┌────────────────────────┐
             │     Target Server      │
             │                        │
             │    Node Exporter       │
             │                        │
             │  CPU / Memory / Disk   │
             │  Network / Uptime      │
             └────────────────────────┘
```

### Overall Process

```text
Node Exporter
      ↓
Exposes System Metrics
      ↓
Prometheus
      ↓
Collects & Stores Metrics
      ↓
Grafana
      ↓
Creates Dashboards & Visualizations
```

## Important Ports

```text
Prometheus      → 9090
Grafana         → 3000
Node Exporter   → 9100
```

